### ============================================================================
### Migrate.http — Health check and database migration requests.
###
### These are anonymous endpoints — no JWT token required.
### Use them to diagnose Azure deployment issues.
### ============================================================================


### ============================================================================
### Health Check
### GET /api/diagnostic/health — Tests DB connectivity and migration status.
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostic/health

### ============================================================================
### Migrate Databases
### POST /api/diagnostic/migrate — Manually triggers EF Core migrations
### for master DB + all tenant DBs.
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostic/migrate
